surrounding you by nasties, *before* you are able to get MR.  I find it 
a nice feature of the game, that lichs start appearing about the same 
time as you can have a guaranteed wish.  To deal with one or two lichs 
before having MR is not too bad; when they get plentiful, you just need 
MR.  I wonder:  There was a discussion once on this group about 
ascending without MR.  Has anyone ever done this "conduct"?

